# Lucent contract ids — printed by `pnpm deploy:contracts` (also in
# deployments/testnet.json). Copy this file to .env.local and fill them in so the
# Payroll and Escrow screens can find their contracts. Without them, those two
# screens show a "not configured" notice; Shield/Send/Auditor/Prove work off the
# ids baked into lib/deployment.ts.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYROLL_ID=C...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ESCROW_FACTORY_ID=C...

# Optional Goldsky indexer (see packages/indexer/). When set, the app backfills
# events older than the RPC's ~7-day window from the indexer; unset, it runs
# RPC-only. Copy to .env.local and point at a deployed Worker.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_INDEXER_URL=https://confidential-token-indexer.<account>.workers.dev
